    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the Big Dig Energy it takes to go deeper than anyone before? Grab your pickaxe, call your bearded brethren, and embrace the life of a Big Dig Dwarf in the best digging game ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through layers of dirt, rock, and volatile terrain. The deeper you dig, the more powerful the energy ores and rare treasures you\u2019ll uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/7be07060630c631aefce44c109fa52d2.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/7be07060630c631aefce44c109fa52d2.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/7be07060630c631aefce44c109fa52d2.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your puny starter tools won\u2019t cut it in the depths. Hurl ores into the furnace to generate energy, upgrade your gear, and dig like a legendary dwarf should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/ac9e35d98cf73dcbd9fd74a22423bf5b.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/ac9e35d98cf73dcbd9fd74a22423bf5b.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/ac9e35d98cf73dcbd9fd74a22423bf5b.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who needs solo mining when you can bring your crew? Team up with up to 3 other dwarves, gain energy, and experience underground mayhem together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/54cbe2dd32989ec9e8b8188683c9cd8c.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/54cbe2dd32989ec9e8b8188683c9cd8c.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/54cbe2dd32989ec9e8b8188683c9cd8c.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about digging deep, it\u2019s about digging smart. Plan your route and blast your way back to the surface with your pack full. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/eab236bc98db8654b7ca2e29d16e03aa.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/eab236bc98db8654b7ca2e29d16e03aa.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/eab236bc98db8654b7ca2e29d16e03aa.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no rules\u2014just beards and Big Dig Energy. Get ready to dig like you\u2019ve never dug before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing my game you support me, &quot;<strong>Mike</strong>&quot;, a solo indie developer. I plan to produce updates to the game to bring a more enjoyable experience and expand on the content. Thanks for your support!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the Big Dig Energy it takes to go deeper than anyone before? Grab your pickaxe, call your bearded brethren, and embrace the life of a Big Dig Dwarf in the best digging game ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through layers of dirt, rock, and volatile terrain. The deeper you dig, the more powerful the energy ores and rare treasures you\u2019ll uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/7be07060630c631aefce44c109fa52d2.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/7be07060630c631aefce44c109fa52d2.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/7be07060630c631aefce44c109fa52d2.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your puny starter tools won\u2019t cut it in the depths. Hurl ores into the furnace to generate energy, upgrade your gear, and dig like a legendary dwarf should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/ac9e35d98cf73dcbd9fd74a22423bf5b.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/ac9e35d98cf73dcbd9fd74a22423bf5b.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/ac9e35d98cf73dcbd9fd74a22423bf5b.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who needs solo mining when you can bring your crew? Team up with up to 3 other dwarves, gain energy, and experience underground mayhem together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/54cbe2dd32989ec9e8b8188683c9cd8c.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/54cbe2dd32989ec9e8b8188683c9cd8c.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/54cbe2dd32989ec9e8b8188683c9cd8c.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about digging deep, it\u2019s about digging smart. Plan your route and blast your way back to the surface with your pack full. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/eab236bc98db8654b7ca2e29d16e03aa.poster.avif?t=1754151074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/eab236bc98db8654b7ca2e29d16e03aa.webm?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560910/extras/eab236bc98db8654b7ca2e29d16e03aa.mp4?t=1754151074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rush, no rules\u2014just beards and Big Dig Energy. Get ready to dig like you\u2019ve never dug before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing my game you support me, &quot;<strong>Mike</strong>&quot;, a solo indie developer. I plan to produce updates to the game to bring a more enjoyable experience and expand on the content. Thanks for your support!</p>",
